<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - ING raises Aegon EPS forecasts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - ING raises Aegon EPS forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Jan 3 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Aegon	     Insurance     112.50  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: HOLD (reiterated). The acquisition of the insurance activities of U.S. Providian Corp. will have a positive impact on earnings per share growth. Since the top line growth of Providian does not look very exciting, we expect the positive earnings impact will primarily come from cost synergy and the way the acquisition is financed. The jump in the share price sufficiently reflects the positive impact of the announced takeover and therefore we maintain our Hold recommendation.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	 5.04		 22.2     2.37</p>
<p>    1996		    5.85   (5.85)    19.1     2.75</p>
<p>    1997		    6.77   (6.45)    16.5     3.18</p>
<p>    1998		    7.82   (7.13)    14.3     3.68</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
